────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NOTE ON SOURCE MATERIAL
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The underlying legal texts referenced in this corpus (United States
Code sections, federal court decisions, CFPB enforcement orders, and
agency guidance documents) are works of the United States Government
or quotations from public court records and are themselves in the
public domain or otherwise freely usable.

The CC-BY-4.0 license applies to the ORIGINAL CONTRIBUTIONS of this
project: the selection of documents, the chunking strategy, the
summaries, the tag vocabulary, the schema design, and the
annotations. Users are free to use these contributions for any
purpose with attribution. The underlying legal texts carry no
additional restriction from this project.
